 "c": [
  {"i":4319,"t":["body","animals"],"n":"Nails and claws/talons are one core sense, so animals belongs in t. The sense 1 entry only repeated t, so it is dropped."},
  {"i":4321,"t":["food","actions"],"s":{"1":["law"],"3":["body"],"6":["feelings"]},"n":"Sunburn (日に焼ける) is taught with skin and the body; weather adds little to that sense. Fire, as an emergency, goes to law, and jealousy to feelings."},
  {"i":4333,"t":["law","work"],"n":"There is only one sense, so no sense entry. Learners mostly meet 訓練 as drills (避難訓練), military training and job training (職業訓練). Sports practice is usually 練習 or トレーニング, so sports is dropped."},
  {"i":4336,"t":["thinking","actions"],"s":{"1":["actions","law"],"3":["feelings"]},"n":"With the 捉える spelling the main use is grasping meaning (問題を捉える, 特徴を捉える), so thinking comes first. Physical catching and arresting is sense 1, which adds law. Being moved goes to feelings."},
  {"i":4405,"t":["colours","money"],"s":{"3":["sports"],"4":["food"],"5":["law"],"6":["technology"]},"n":"Ball and sphere fit colours as a shape. Learners mostly meet 玉 in coins (百円玉) and お年玉, so money beats the loose qualities. Sports, food, bullet and bulb senses keep their own entries."},
  {"i":4439,"t":["qualities","communication"],"n":"曖昧 is taught with vague answers and expressions (曖昧な返事, 曖昧な態度), not as a language or grammar word."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":4304,"keep":[2],"n":"心が乱れる is a common emotional sense; 'lapse into chaos' is mostly literary"},
  {"i":4310,"keep":[],"n":"Learners meet 派 mainly as faction (賛成派), which fits society; school/sect senses are rarer"},
  {"i":4318,"keep":[],"n":"'Or so' is not a numbers unit word; 'such a matter' is colloquial and is taught with ko-so-a-do under position"},
  {"i":4321,"keep":[1,3],"n":"家が焼ける (fire, emergencies) and 日に焼ける (sunburn) are common; 'jealous' is usually 妬ける and rare"},
  {"i":4324,"keep":[2],"n":"番組の提供 (sponsoring) is common on TV and belongs in media"},
  {"i":4325,"keep":[5,6],"n":"筋が通る (logic) and 話の筋 (plot) are both common and fit thinking and arts"},
  {"i":4326,"keep":[],"n":"Venting feelings is a figurative extension"},
  {"i":4336,"keep":[],"n":"Arrest is usually 捕らえる and catching is already covered by actions; captivating the heart is figurative"},
  {"i":4337,"keep":[2],"n":"豊かな生活/国 (wealthy) is common and taught with money"},
  {"i":4343,"keep":[2],"n":"城跡/遺跡 (ruins) is taught with history and sightseeing; scar mostly appears as the compound 傷跡"},
  {"i":4362,"keep":[],"n":"Police raid and 'get to the core' are news or figurative senses beyond this level; stepping in fits movement"},
  {"i":4364,"keep":[],"n":"'Turbulent era' is a figurative, literary sense"},
  {"i":4371,"keep":[2],"n":"関係を築く is a very common collocation in relationships"},
  {"i":4372,"keep":[],"n":"'Fishy/suspicious' is colloquial and figurative"},
  {"i":4375,"keep":[2],"n":"会社/店が潰れる (go bankrupt) is very common and belongs in business"},
  {"i":4376,"keep":[],"n":"Railway appears only in compounds such as 地下鉄/鉄道; 'railway enthusiast' is slang"},
  {"i":4378,"keep":[],"n":"Array element is a technical sense"},
  {"i":4382,"keep":[4],"n":"試験に滑る and 滑り止め are common student vocabulary taught with exams"},
  {"i":4387,"keep":[4],"n":"予定が埋まる (schedule filled) is common and fits schedules"},
  {"i":4392,"keep":[],"n":"Patching clothes is old-fashioned; inheriting fits t"},
  {"i":4401,"keep":[],"n":"The spatial sense is rare; ゴール寸前 still reads as timing"},
  {"i":4404,"keep":[],"n":"'Senior/big bro' is slangy and not taught in a people or relationships unit"},
  {"i":4405,"keep":[],"n":"Sports ball is usually 球, bullet is usually 弾, bulb is usually 電球; the noodle sense is rare"},
  {"i":4407,"keep":[2,5],"n":"鈍い人 (slow-witted, insensitive) is a common description of personality"},
  {"i":4410,"keep":[2],"n":"レモンを絞る (squeezing juice) is common in cooking; 知恵を絞る is an idiom"},
  {"i":4414,"keep":[],"n":"'Closing time' (看板です) is bar jargon"},
  {"i":4416,"keep":[3],"n":"免許停止/営業停止 (suspension, ban) is common and fits rules"},
  {"i":4423,"keep":[],"n":"Unity (一致団結) is close to agreement, which is already covered by t"},
  {"i":4426,"keep":[],"n":"Learners meet 変態 as 'pervert'; metamorphosis and transformation are technical"},
  {"i":4429,"keep":[],"n":"Supporting role occurs only in the compound 脇役"},
  {"i":4434,"keep":[],"n":"'Burn with passion' is figurative"},
  {"i":4436,"keep":[2],"n":"器が大きい (a person's calibre) is a common description of character"},
  {"i":4440,"keep":[2],"n":"腕/スキルを磨く (honing skills) is common in study and work contexts"},
  {"i":4450,"keep":[2],"n":"予算/経費を削る (cutting the budget) is common and belongs in money"}
